Shark Tale is a animation, action, comedy film directed by Vicky Jenson.

3
00:12:16,363 --> 00:12:22,363
Oscar is a small fish whose big aspirations often get him into trouble.

4
00:16:21,818 --> 00:16:27,818
Meanwhile, Lenny is a great white shark with a surprising secret
that no sea creature would guess: He's a vegetarian.

5
00:20:27,272 --> 00:20:33,272
When a lie turns Oscar into an improbable hero and Lenny becomes
an outcast, the two form an unlikely friendship.

